<title>FRANCE: France reports free-mkt wheat, barley, durum bids.</title>
<headline>France reports free-mkt wheat, barley, durum bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Dec 5 ---		 --- Nov 28---</p>
<p>		 Tonnage   Range of Bids    Tonnage  Range of bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat  662,800   17.93-21.87	550,700   16.49-22.35</p>
<p> Barley	296,000   30.50-32.00	182,000   31.00-33.49</p>
<p> Rye	   No bids reported		 5,000   31.49-31.95</p>
<p> Durum wheat  49,800    4.98-30.00	 None</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
